{
  "slots": [
    {
      "slot_id": "line_0001",
      "speech_id": "speech_0001",
      "source": {
        "episode_id": "ep-1-d4a62b9d",
        "scene_id": "ep1-scene1",
        "line_id": "ep1-s1-l1"
      },
      "kind": "sfx",
      "text": "远处传来模糊的车辆引擎声，由远及近，又渐渐消失。",
      "identity_id": null
    },
    {
      "slot_id": "line_0002",
      "speech_id": "speech_0002",
      "source": {
        "episode_id": "ep-1-d4a62b9d",
        "scene_id": "ep1-scene1",
        "line_id": "ep1-s1-l2"
      },
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "text": "还好是十九点十五分的车，不用着急。",
      "identity_id": "legend-moyu"
    },
    {
      "slot_id": "line_0003",
      "speech_id": "speech_0003",
      "source": {
        "episode_id": "ep-1-d4a62b9d",
        "scene_id": "ep1-scene1",
        "line_id": "ep1-s1-l3"
      },
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "text": "等等，我记得通知上写的是十八点四十五分。",
      "identity_id": "legend-lingmo"
    },
    {
      "slot_id": "line_0004",
      "speech_id": "speech_0004",
      "source": {
        "episode_id": "ep-1-d4a62b9d",
        "scene_id": "ep1-scene1",
        "line_id": "ep1-s1-l4"
      },
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "text": "不可能，我记得明明是十九点十五分。",
      "identity_id": "legend-moyu"
    },
    {
      "slot_id": "line_0005",
      "speech_id": "speech_0005",
      "source": {
        "episode_id": "ep-1-d4a62b9d",
        "scene_id": "ep1-scene1",
        "line_id": "ep1-s1-l5"
      },
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "text": "通知上写的是三号站台，十八点四十五分，最后一班车。",
      "identity_id": "legend-lingmo"
    },
    {
      "slot_id": "line_0006",
      "speech_id": "speech_0006",
      "source": {
        "episode_id": "ep-1-d4a62b9d",
        "scene_id": "ep1-scene1",
        "line_id": "ep1-s1-l6"
      },
      "kind": "action",
      "text": "墨羽翻找口袋，拿出通知。",
      "identity_id": null
    },
    {
      "slot_id": "line_0007",
      "speech_id": "speech_0007",
      "source": {
        "episode_id": "ep-1-d4a62b9d",
        "scene_id": "ep1-scene1",
        "line_id": "ep1-s1-l7"
      },
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "text": "十八点四十五分……",
      "identity_id": "legend-moyu"
    },
    {
      "slot_id": "line_0008",
      "speech_id": "speech_0008",
      "source": {
        "episode_id": "ep-1-d4a62b9d",
        "scene_id": "ep1-scene1",
        "line_id": "ep1-s1-l8"
      },
      "kind": "action",
      "text": "短暂的沉默。",
      "identity_id": null
    },
    {
      "slot_id": "line_0009",
      "speech_id": "speech_0009",
      "source": {
        "episode_id": "ep-1-d4a62b9d",
        "scene_id": "ep1-scene1",
        "line_id": "ep1-s1-l9"
      },
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "text": "我记成十九点十五分了。",
      "identity_id": "legend-moyu"
    },
    {
      "slot_id": "line_0010",
      "speech_id": "speech_0010",
      "source": {
        "episode_id": "ep-1-d4a62b9d",
        "scene_id": "ep1-scene1",
        "line_id": "ep1-s1-l10"
      },
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "text": "现在赶过去应该还来得及。",
      "identity_id": "legend-lingmo"
    },
    {
      "slot_id": "line_0011",
      "speech_id": "speech_0011",
      "source": {
        "episode_id": "ep-1-d4a62b9d",
        "scene_id": "ep1-scene2",
        "line_id": "ep1-s2-l1"
      },
      "kind": "sfx",
      "text": "急促的脚步声响起，由慢变快，两个人的步伐混杂在一起。",
      "identity_id": null
    },
    {
      "slot_id": "line_0012",
      "speech_id": "speech_0012",
      "source": {
        "episode_id": "ep-1-d4a62b9d",
        "scene_id": "ep1-scene2",
        "line_id": "ep1-s2-l2"
      },
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "text": "我怎么就没仔细看呢……",
      "identity_id": "legend-moyu"
    },
    {
      "slot_id": "line_0013",
      "speech_id": "speech_0013",
      "source": {
        "episode_id": "ep-1-d4a62b9d",
        "scene_id": "ep1-scene2",
        "line_id": "ep1-s2-l3"
      },
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "text": "这边，三号站台在那边。",
      "identity_id": "legend-lingmo"
    },
    {
      "slot_id": "line_0014",
      "speech_id": "speech_0014",
      "source": {
        "episode_id": "ep-1-d4a62b9d",
        "scene_id": "ep1-scene2",
        "line_id": "ep1-s2-l4"
      },
      "kind": "sfx",
      "text": "脚步声持续，节奏加快。远处传来车辆进站的提示音，伴随着刹车声，由远及近。",
      "identity_id": null
    },
    {
      "slot_id": "line_0015",
      "speech_id": "speech_0015",
      "source": {
        "episode_id": "ep-1-d4a62b9d",
        "scene_id": "ep1-scene2",
        "line_id": "ep1-s2-l5"
      },
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "text": "等等我们！",
      "identity_id": "legend-moyu"
    },
    {
      "slot_id": "line_0016",
      "speech_id": "speech_0016",
      "source": {
        "episode_id": "ep-1-d4a62b9d",
        "scene_id": "ep1-scene2",
        "line_id": "ep1-s2-l6"
      },
      "kind": "sfx",
      "text": "脚步声渐缓，车门打开的气压声响起，清晰而近。",
      "identity_id": null
    },
    {
      "slot_id": "line_0017",
      "speech_id": "speech_0017",
      "source": {
        "episode_id": "ep-1-d4a62b9d",
        "scene_id": "ep1-scene3",
        "line_id": "ep1-s3-l1"
      },
      "kind": "action",
      "text": "两人喘息声渐平。",
      "identity_id": null
    },
    {
      "slot_id": "line_0018",
      "speech_id": "speech_0018",
      "source": {
        "episode_id": "ep-1-d4a62b9d",
        "scene_id": "ep1-scene3",
        "line_id": "ep1-s3-l2"
      },
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "text": "以后得先看清通知。",
      "identity_id": "legend-moyu"
    },
    {
      "slot_id": "line_0019",
      "speech_id": "speech_0019",
      "source": {
        "episode_id": "ep-1-d4a62b9d",
        "scene_id": "ep1-scene3",
        "line_id": "ep1-s3-l3"
      },
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "text": "嗯，我们一起看。",
      "identity_id": "legend-lingmo"
    },
    {
      "slot_id": "line_0020",
      "speech_id": "speech_0020",
      "source": {
        "episode_id": "ep-1-d4a62b9d",
        "scene_id": "ep1-scene3",
        "line_id": "ep1-s3-l4"
      },
      "kind": "sfx",
      "text": "车辆启动，引擎声渐强后渐弱，逐渐远去。",
      "identity_id": null
    }
  ],
